window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-df63feb0e4c5382b"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"scope-an-analytics-request\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">界定分析请求范围</h1> <p>将含糊的利益相关方请求转化为经过验证的分析计划。</p> <p>向 ChatGPT 提供利益相关方的请求、业务背景、指标词汇表、来源导出文件、仪表板链接和请求讨论串，然后请它界定问题、找出缺少的输入、先做一轮分析，并准备可供审阅的答复。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>以宽泛问题形式提出、但没有明确指标定义或分析范围的数据分析请求。</li> <li>需要在承诺给出答案前找出数据来源缺口的分析人员。</li> <li>需要包含图表、验证说明和待确认问题的利益相关方答复。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>检查来源导出文件、测试联接，并先运行一轮计算。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive（需联网）</a></td> <td>查找指标词汇表、仪表板、来源文件和以往分析。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack（需联网）</a></td> <td>阅读原始请求及相关的利益相关方背景。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>将范围明确的分析整理成适合利益相关方阅读、并附有审阅备注的答复。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">起步提示词</h2> <p>界定这项分析请求的范围</p> <p>建议推理级别：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">将这项请求整理成范围明确的分析：[paste request or link to source context]（粘贴请求内容或提供来源背景链接）。\n\n找出业务问题、必需的指标定义、来源导出文件、相关仪表板，以及近期产品或业务背景。起草分析计划，使用现有数据先做一轮分析，验证结果，并准备附有图表、注意事项、来源链接和待解问题、供分析人员审查的答复。\n\n不要假定指标定义、联接逻辑或缺失值的处理方式。列出在分析定稿前需要我确认的每一项输入或决定。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-data-science-teams-use-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy：数据科学团队（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-99d1e8fe39794227\">查询表格数据</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"turn-the-ask-into-an-analysis-contract\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">将请求整理成分析约定</h2> <p>利益相关方的请求常常把业务问题、偏好的图表和假定的指标定义混在一起。把原始请求和相关背景交给 ChatGPT，再请它在分析前列明问题、定义、来源、联接方式和需要作出的决定。</p> <ol> <li>附上请求讨论串、指标词汇表、仪表板、导出文件和相关背景。</li> <li>请 ChatGPT 列出已知、含糊、缺失或不属于范围的内容。</li> <li>确认指标定义、联接逻辑、时间范围和目标受众。</li> <li>运行起步提示词，先生成一版分析及适合利益相关方阅读的答复。</li> <li>请分析人员审查计算、图表、注意事项和待解问题。</li> </ol> <p>不要让看似自信的答案掩盖未定义的指标或未经验证的联接。分析计划本身就是交付物的一部分，因为它能让下一轮更容易审查。</p> <p><a id=\"close-the-loop-with-the-requester\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_7\">与请求者确认并闭环</h2> <p>分析审查完成后，请 ChatGPT 把待解问题整理成简短的确认说明，但不要发送。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Turn the open questions into a requester review note.\n\nInclude:\n\n- the business question I answered\n- definitions and filters used\n- source files and joins\n- the main result and caveats\n- questions that need confirmation\n- the next analysis I can run after confirmation\n\nKeep unsupported claims out and return a draft only.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">将待解决的问题整理成一份供需求提出者审阅的说明。\n\n包含：\n\n- 我回答了哪个业务问题\n- 使用的定义和筛选条件\n- 源文件及数据关联方式\n- 主要结果和注意事项\n- 需要确认的问题\n- 确认后我可以继续开展的分析\n\n不要加入缺乏依据的主张，只返回草稿。</div></div>","en":"<h1 id=\"scope-an-analytics-request\">Scope an analytics request</h1> <p>Turn an ambiguous stakeholder ask into a validated analysis plan.</p> <p>Give ChatGPT the stakeholder request, business context, metric glossary, source exports, dashboard links, and request threads, then ask it to scope the question, identify missing inputs, run a first pass, and prepare a reviewable answer.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Analytics requests that arrive as broad questions without clear metric definitions or scope.</li> <li>Analysts who need to identify source gaps before committing to an answer.</li> <li>Stakeholder-ready analysis that should include charts, validation notes, and open questions.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>$spreadsheets</code></td> <td>Inspect source exports, test joins, and run the first-pass calculations.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/google-drive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">google-drive (online)</a></td> <td>Find metric glossaries, dashboards, source files, and prior analysis.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/plugins/tree/main/plugins/slack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">slack (online)</a></td> <td>Read the original request and surrounding stakeholder context.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>$documents</code></td> <td>Turn the scoped analysis into a stakeholder-ready answer with review notes.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Scope this analytics request</p> <p>Suggested reasoning effort：<code>medium</code></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Turn this request into a scoped analysis: [paste request or link to source context].\n\nIdentify the business question, required metric definitions, source exports, relevant dashboards, and recent product or business context. Draft an analysis plan, run a first-pass analysis using the available data, validate the outputs, and prepare a stakeholder-ready answer with charts, caveats, source links, and open questions for analyst review.\n\nDo not assume metric definitions, join logic, or missing values. List every input or decision you need confirmed before the analysis is final.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://openai.com/academy/codex-for-work/how-data-science-teams-use-codex/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Academy: Data science teams (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-99d1e8fe39794227\">Query tabular data</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"turn-the-ask-into-an-analysis-contract\">Turn the ask into an analysis contract</h2> <p>Stakeholder requests often mix the business question, a preferred chart, and an assumed metric definition. Give ChatGPT the original request and surrounding context, then ask it to identify the question, definitions, sources, joins, and decisions before it analyzes.</p> <ol> <li>Attach the request thread, metric glossary, dashboards, exports, and relevant context.</li> <li>Ask ChatGPT to list what is known, ambiguous, missing, or out of scope.</li> <li>Confirm the metric definitions, join logic, time window, and intended audience.</li> <li>Run the starter prompt for a first-pass analysis and stakeholder-ready answer.</li> <li>Have an analyst review the calculations, charts, caveats, and open questions.</li> </ol> <p>Do not let a confident answer hide an undefined metric or unverified join. The analysis plan is part of the deliverable because it makes the next iteration faster to review.</p> <h2 id=\"close-the-loop-with-the-requester\">Close the loop with the requester</h2> <p>After the analysis is reviewed, ask ChatGPT to turn the open questions into a short confirmation note without sending it.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Turn the open questions into a requester review note.\n\nInclude:\n\n- the business question I answered\n- definitions and filters used\n- source files and joins\n- the main result and caveats\n- questions that need confirmation\n- the next analysis I can run after confirmation\n\nKeep unsupported claims out and return a draft only.\n</code></pre>"};
